glyphmaniac_desc=<name> once ate a weird crystal, which has resulted in them summoning magic glyphs when they sneeze. They will occasionally spawn a random glyph when in combat or in an adventure party. Frequency starts at <seconds> seconds and gets <percent> faster for each quality of life level
