inspiring_desc=<name> is simply just the best! They will give other settlers they talk to a happiness boost for some time. Bonus starts at <value> happiness and increases with <percent> for each quality of life level
inspiring_effect=<value> happiness boost
inspiringreceived=I've had a truly inspiring conversation recently
warrior=Warrior
warrior_desc=<name> has been brawling ever since they were a kid. As they grew older, fists were replaced with swords and they now excel at melee combat. They will get bonuses based on their quality of life level
ranger=Ranger
ranger_desc=<name> feels the wind, breathes, and fires. Because a true marksman, only needs one arrow. They will get bonuses based on their quality of life level
