converteaworld1=IMPORTANT:
converteaworld2=The world you're trying to load is from the early access version of Necesse.
converteaworld3=The world needs to be migrated to the new continuous procedural generation system.
converteaworld4=We highly recommend starting a new world to experience all the new features and terrain generation.
converteaworld5=Migrating will place the generated islands from your old world in the new world so you can walk between them. This means any newly generated terrain will have jarring borders between the old islands and the new terrain.
converteaworld6=Depending on how many islands you have explored and how fast your computer is, this may take a while.
