eanotice=Notice:\nThis is an early access build.\n\nYou might encounter bugs, missing, incomplete or unpolished features.\n\nThank you for playing!
fullreleasenotice1=Necesse has finally reached version 1.0!
fullreleasenotice2=Thank you to everyone who has played, given feedback, reported bugs and shared the game during Early Access.
fullreleasenotice3=Launching as a solo passion project, the game literally wouldn't exist without you.
fullreleasenotice4=The 1.0 update brings some significant changes to the game. We highly recommend starting a new save to experience the new features and world generation.
fullreleasenotice5=In the coming weeks we will be fixing bugs and tweaking balance. After that, we will be working on even more additional content and features.
fullreleasenotice6=We hope you enjoy the full release!
fullreleasenotice7=Thank you for playing, from the small and passionate team behind Necesse.
